    {"key":"conditions","label":"Filter conditions","type":"conditions","default":"[{\"column\":\"0\",\"operator\":\"notBlank\",\"value\":\"\"}]","options":[["eq","Number ="],["neq","Number ≠"],["lt","Number <"],["lte","Number ≤"],["gt","Number >"],["gte","Number ≥"],["textEquals","Text equals"],["textNotEquals","Text does not equal"],["contains","Text contains"],["startsWith","Text starts with"],["endsWith","Text ends with"],["blank","Is blank"],["notBlank","Is not blank"]]},
    {"key":"datasetName","label":"New dataset name (blank = automatic)","type":"text","default":"","preview":false}
